# Local and personal — never goes into a shared repository.
#
# .claude/settings.local.json above all: an agent's settings file is executable
# surface, not documentation. CVE-2026-21852 (Claude Code before 2.0.65): a settings
# file in a repository could point ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL at someone else's address, and the
# API key was sent there BEFORE the user accepted the folder-trust dialog. There is no
# recorded incident of a leak through one's own committed settings.local.json — this is
# hygiene. The CVE is named so the reason is visible: this is not "just config".
.claude/settings.local.json
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store

# Dependencies and build output — add your project's own.
# node_modules/
# dist/
